# Commits that only reformatted code, skipped by `git blame` so it keeps pointing at
# whoever actually wrote a line instead of at the run that reindented it.
#
# Enabled by `git config --local blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs`, which npm's
# `prepare` script runs. `--local` is the default, but it's spelled out there so a script
# that runs on every `npm install` can't be misread as touching global git config.
# GitHub reads this file by name on its own.
#
# Full SHAs are required — git rejects abbreviated ones here.

